payment_received.body:
Hello {name},

We received your payment proof for order {code}. Our team will verify it shortly (usually within 1 business day).
{link}

payment_approved.body:
Hello {name},

Your payment for order {code} ({total}) is confirmed. We are preparing your order.
{link}

payment_rejected.body:
Hello {name},

We could not verify your payment proof for order {code}. Please check the details and upload a new proof:
{link}

cod_confirmed.body:
Hello {name},

Your cash-on-delivery order {code} is confirmed. Please prepare {total} in cash (USD) for the courier.
{link}

packed.body:
Hello {name},

Your order {code} is packed and will be dispatched soon.
{link}

out_for_delivery.body:
Hello {name},

Your order {code} is on its way. Please keep your phone close.
{link}

delivered.body:
Hello {name},

Your order {code} was delivered. We hope you love it! You can now review your items:
{link}

cancelled.body:
Hello {name},

Your order {code} was cancelled. If you already paid, we will contact you about the refund.
{link}
